create the Butcher's Shop
  a room
  aka butchers shop, butcher shop, butchers, butchery, holstenoffer's
  south to the Commerce Street, one-way
  states: new, familiar

  Chains of linked sausages and thick, red cuts of meat dangle from hooks in
  the ceiling, and trays of less identifiable bits sit out on the counters.
  It's better than some butcheries you've seen, but it's still not your
  favorite place in the city. You can leave to the south.

  after the player entering while the Butcher's Shop is new
    phrase holstenoffer-ho1-stub
    change the Butcher's Shop to familiar
  end after

  after the player going
    phrase holstenoffer-waves
  end after

