## `story.ni:4757`, the dirty-Jack buying refusal, on the dagger display;
## `buying` is a story dispatch action, so it rides a trait.

define trait buy-from-minor
  on the player buying
    refuse minor-run-along
  end on
end trait

define phrase minor-run-along
  Minor barks an unpleasant laugh. 'Run along, girl, before you cut yourself.'
end phrase

## --- Entry and leaving lines (`story.ni:4340-4349`, `4565-4577`, `4753`) ---

define phrase germaise-nods
  The man behind the counter nods at you amiably as you enter the shop.
end phrase

define phrase germaise-later
  'Later, Germaise,' you call out as you leave.

  'Eh,' grunts Germaise, flapping a flour-dusted hand at you.
end phrase

define phrase holstenoffer-waves
  Holstenoffer waves his bloody cleaver at you as you leave. 'Take care of
  yourself, Jack.'
end phrase

define phrase armory-relief
  You leave the weapons shop with a sense of relief.
end phrase
